{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require all food options to be available within the free school meal allowance",
        "additional_details": "Require schools in England to ensure all canteen food and meal options are priced within the daily free school meal allowance. No child should have food taken away, face embarrassment at the till or pay extra because their allowance is insufficient. The government should introduce national rules so pupils receiving free school meals can choose from the same menu as their peers without financial barriers. Every child deserves equal choice, dignity and access to nutritious food.",
        "background": "Require schools in England to price all canteen food and meals within the daily free school meal allowance. No child should have food taken away or pay extra because their allowance is insufficient. Every child deserves equal choice, dignity and access to food.",
